# Remote node: the Bluetooth link drops. What reaches the node meanwhile (a
# new contact, a DM) shows up once the link is back.
# remote-only
node Bob 7.5 echo
as Bob advert
wait 3000
expect linked 1
expect contacts 1
# Advertise (through the node), so Bob can message us.
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
ble off
wait 500
expect linked 0
node Kim 7
as Kim advert
wait 2000
as Bob dm Cardputer are you there?
wait 3000
shot link-down
ble on
wait 6000
expect linked 1
expect contacts 2
expect unread 1
shot link-back
key enter
wait 300
shot conversation
